<title>JAPAN: Japan to hold rice import tender on May 28.</title>
<headline>Japan to hold rice import tender on May 28.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japanese Food Agency said on Friday that it will hold an import tender for 7,000 tonnes of rice on May 28.  </p>
<p>The tender will be carried out under the simultaneous buy-and-sell (SBS) system, an official of the Food Agency said. This will be the first rice import tender in fiscal 1997/98 (April/March).</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
